# Code ownership for review routing (change management).
# GitHub requests review from the owners below on every PR. That only becomes a
# REQUIREMENT once branch protection on `main` is configured to require
# CODEOWNERS review + passing CI before merge (repository setting, not in this
# file — see CONTRIBUTING.md). With a single owner, the owner's own PRs cannot
# be code-owner-reviewed; add a second maintainer before relying on this as a
# two-person control.

# Default owner for everything.
*                           @thomasunise

